{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254240/", "pk": 254240, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/", "pk": 60827, "shortname": "realfloridaadventures", "name": "Real Florida Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Kennedy Space Center Ultimate Adventure", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Kennedy Space Center Ultimate Adventure", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 3000, "description": "#Kennedy Space Center Ultimate Package\n\n##Duration\n\nApprox. 10.5 Hours\n\n## About This Tour\n\nWhen you want to immerse yourself completely in the space center vibe, this is the adventure for you – transportation and admission to the Visitor Complex, plenty of time to explore all that’s on offer, then the superb Dine with an Astronaut option, and finally a trip ‘behind the gates’ for a two-hour Discover KSC bus tour.\n\nWe rightly label this our ‘Ultimate’ tour as it maximizes every moment at the Space Center with a full-on and in-depth exploration that touches on all the key aspects of the space program.\n\nFirst, there is the chance to get up close and personal with exhibits like the essential Space Shuttle Atlantis (don’t miss this, as it packs a really emotional punch with its big ‘reveal’), the Shuttle Launch Experience, Heroes & Legends center, extensive Rocket Garden, and IMAX Theater.\n\nOnce you have soaked up NASA’s past, present and future, we’ll take you on to the highlight of lunch with one of their veterans, and a chance to hear first-hand about what it takes to be a member of the astronaut corps. Along with a tasty meal, you will have an opportunity to ask questions and have your photograph taken with him or her for a unique souvenir.\n\nThen it’s time to spread your wings a little and head out to see more of the full 144,000-acre extent of the KSC, which was founded in 1962 by President Kennedy and has been growing ever since.\n\nThis unique behind-the-scenes bus tour provides rare close-up views of the signature sights such as the gigantic Vehicle Assembly Building – the tallest one-story structure in the world – the historic launch sites and other operational facilities before concluding at the fascinating Apollo/Saturn V Center, home to a full-size Saturn V rocket, a moon-landing recreation, and a piece of moon-rock you can actually touch.\n\nIt’s as close as you can get to being an astronaut without actually joining NASA!\n\n**Included**\n•\tAdmission into Kennedy Space Center Visitors complex \n•\tChef prepared lunch with an experienced veteran of NASA’s Space Program\n•\tUp Close Discover KSC Bus Tour\n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tMeals and Drinks not mentioned\n•\tGratuities\n\n\n##Pickup Time and Schedule\n\n**Margaritaville Resort Orlando** at 7:15am\n*8000 Fins Up Cir, Kissimmee, FL 34747*\n\n**Golden Corral** at 7:30am\n**8707 Vineland Ave, Orlando, FL 32821**\n  \n**Orlando Star Flyer at Icon Park** at 8am \n*8265 International Dr, Orlando, FL 32819*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "We look forward to seeing you soon!\n\n#Kennedy Space Center Ultimate Experience\n\n**Included**\n•\tAdmission into Kennedy Space Center Visitors complex \n•\tChef prepared lunch with an experienced veteran of NASA’s Space Program\n•\tUp Close Discover KSC Bus Tour\n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tMeals and Drinks not mentioned\n•\tGratuities\n\n##What to bring\nSunscreen, Sunglasses, Camera’s, Proof of Confirmation", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All ages • Approx. 10.5 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254240/images/481037/", "pk": 481037, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1kKai6OnSIuK5ZtClKQW", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1kKai6OnSIuK5ZtClKQW", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254240/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1kKai6OnSIuK5ZtClKQW", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/1kKai6OnSIuK5ZtClKQW", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254240/images/481032/", "pk": 481032, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BTiJvXptSfugeIMiD2YB", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/BTiJvXptSfugeIMiD2YB", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/ite